    "text": [
      "Tell me one thing, ",
      {
        "type": "mention",
        "text": "@SoWut"
      },
      ". Are you a one or a zero? This is the question you need to ask yourself. Are you a yes or a no? Will you act or not? You won't give any hints: you have decided to do nothing, to say no, to be mysterious as usual. You leave, you decided not to give the rose some water it needs. You become a zero, a black rose. If you stay, if you decide to help us, to give us some hints, then you become a yes. You become one. The red rose. So I ask you again: are you one or zero? The red rose or the black one?"
    ],
